{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify Liquid and CSS developer specializing in high-end, editorial e-commerce design (Apothecary Minimalism aesthetic). Write the complete, production-ready code for a multi-column partnership/pricing tier section that replicates the layout and typography of image_5f043a.png 100% with exact visual precision, intentional whitespace hierarchy, and structural logic.
    
    ### Section Configuration & Schema Requirements:
    1. Wrap the entire layout in a fully customizable Shopify theme section.
    2. **Global & Header Settings:** Include settings for the section background color, main uppercase kicker text (default: "PARTNERSHIP TYPES"), and the primary serif heading (default: "Find your role\nin the ritual.").
    3. **Dynamic Columns Schema:** Use a blocks schema (`blocks`) capped at a maximum of 3 blocks so the merchant can customize each partnership column. Each block must include settings for:
       - Top accent border color (Color picker).
       - Small uppercase audience kicker text (e.g., "FOR TATTOO STUDIOS").
       - Main card serif title (e.g., "Studio Partner").
       - Features list (Rich text or a multi-line text area where each line automatically splits into a list item with a custom horizontal dash prefix).
       - Bottom footer helper text (e.g., "Minimum 3-month commitment").
       - Bottom image picker (to replace the solid gray placeholder block at the base of the outer columns).
    4. Include standard `{% schema %}` with presets so it can be added directly via the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ### Visual & Style Specifications (1:1 Replication):
    1. **Global Layout & Editorial Spacing:**
       - **Background:** An ultra-clean, warm, low-saturation off-white/muted stone background (`#ebe9e6` or similar warm gray tint).
       - **Container:** Max-width of 1400px with generous, intentional whitespace. The main header area sits on its own row with significant breathing room before the column grid begins.
       - **Grid System:** A balanced 3-column layout on desktop separated by thin, elegant vertical divider lines (`1px solid #d1cfcc`). The columns must feature an intentional asymmetry or offset: the middle card sits lower or has unique padding, and the outer cards feature solid structural blocks/images at their base while the center column drops lower with text. On mobile, columns stack cleanly.
    
    2. **Typography Hierarchy:**
       - **Section Kicker:** Small, light, tracking-wide uppercase sans-serif font in a muted slate-gray, positioned at the very top left.
       - **Main Headline:** Large, high-end editorial serif font (e.g., Century Schoolbook, Italianastyle, or similar premium serif available in Shopify font library) with a distinct tight line-height, displaying an elegant, natural line break.
       - **Column Kickers:** Tiny, wide-tracked uppercase sans-serif font matching the accent color of the horizontal line above it.
       - **Column Titles:** Medium-sized elegant serif font mirroring the main section headline style, left-aligned.
    
    3. **Column Structure & Component Elements:**
       - **Top Accent Rule:** Every column starts with a prominent horizontal rule (`border-top: 3px solid`). The color must be customizable per block (e.g., deep charcoal for columns 1 and 3, and an earthy terracotta/clay orange for the central featured column).
       - **List Items:** Features must be left-aligned and cleanly spaced. Each item is preceded by an elegant horizontal dash block (`—`) matching the card’s accent theme color, followed by crisp, low-contrast charcoal gray body text (`#4a4a4a`).
       - **Bottom Structure:** A light horizontal line separates the features list from the small, muted gray footnote text at the base.
       - **Base Blocks:** The bottom of the columns must accommodate the precise layout asymmetry shown: columns 1 and 3 anchor cleanly into a solid geometric layout block (or placeholder image container with a soft tint), while column 2 extends further down with minimal text baseline alignment.
    
    Output only the clean, copy-pasteable code containing the HTML structure, embedded CSS (or Tailwind utility classes), and the Shopify Liquid schema.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-partnership-tiers-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: 80px 20px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-partnership-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-partnership-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .ai-partnership-kicker-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.kicker_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.kicker_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6b6b6b;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-partnership-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font.style }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }

  .ai-partnership-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    border-left: 1px solid #d1cfcc;
  }

  .ai-partnership-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-right: 1px solid #d1cfcc;
    padding: 40px 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-partnership-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
    padding-top: 80px;
  }

  .ai-partnership-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 3px;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-partnership-audience-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.kicker_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.kicker_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-partnership-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font.style }};
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
  }

  .ai-partnership-features-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 40px 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-partnership-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #4a4a4a;
  }

  .ai-partnership-dash-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-right: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ai-partnership-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e3e0;
    padding-top: 20px;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .ai-partnership-helper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #888888;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-partnership-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 24px;
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-partnership-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-partnership-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #d8d6d3;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-partnership-tiers-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .ai-partnership-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .ai-partnership-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-partnership-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      border-left: none;
    }

    .ai-partnership-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #d1cfcc;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    .ai-partnership-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
      padding-top: 40px;
    }

    .ai-partnership-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<partnership-tiers-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-partnership-tiers-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-partnership-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-partnership-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.kicker_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-partnership-kicker-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.kicker_text }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.main_heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-partnership-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.main_heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-partnership-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.column_1_enabled %}
        <div class="ai-partnership-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-partnership-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="background-color: {{ block.settings.column_1_accent_color }};"></div>
          
          {% if block.settings.column_1_audience_kicker != blank %}
            <div class="ai-partnership-audience-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="color: {{ block.settings.column_1_accent_color }};">
              {{ block.settings.column_1_audience_kicker }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.column_1_card_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-partnership-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_1_card_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.column_1_features_list != blank %}
            <ul class="ai-partnership-features-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% assign features = block.settings.column_1_features_list | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' %}
              {% for feature in features %}
                {% assign trimmed_feature = feature | strip %}
                {% if trimmed_feature != blank %}
                  <li class="ai-partnership-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <span class="ai-partnership-dash-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="color: {{ block.settings.column_1_accent_color }};">—</span>
                    <span>{{ trimmed_feature }}</span>
                  </li>
                {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ai-partnership-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.column_1_footer_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-partnership-helper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_1_footer_text }}</div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.column_1_bottom_image %}
              <div class="ai-partnership-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <img
                  src="{{ block.settings.column_1_bottom_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                  alt="{{ block.settings.column_1_bottom_image.alt | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ block.settings.column_1_bottom_image.width }}"
                  height="{{ block.settings.column_1_bottom_image.height }}"
                >
              </div>
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-partnership-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-partnership-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.column_2_enabled %}
        <div class="ai-partnership-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-partnership-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="background-color: {{ block.settings.column_2_accent_color }};"></div>
          
          {% if block.settings.column_2_audience_kicker != blank %}
            <div class="ai-partnership-audience-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="color: {{ block.settings.column_2_accent_color }};">
              {{ block.settings.column_2_audience_kicker }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.column_2_card_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-partnership-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_2_card_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.column_2_features_list != blank %}
            <ul class="ai-partnership-features-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% assign features = block.settings.column_2_features_list | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' %}
              {% for feature in features %}
                {% assign trimmed_feature = feature | strip %}
                {% if trimmed_feature != blank %}
                  <li class="ai-partnership-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <span class="ai-partnership-dash-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="color: {{ block.settings.column_2_accent_color }};">—</span>
                    <span>{{ trimmed_feature }}</span>
                  </li>
                {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ai-partnership-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.column_2_footer_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-partnership-helper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_2_footer_text }}</div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.column_2_bottom_image %}
              <div class="ai-partnership-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <img
                  src="{{ block.settings.column_2_bottom_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                  alt="{{ block.settings.column_2_bottom_image.alt | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ block.settings.column_2_bottom_image.width }}"
                  height="{{ block.settings.column_2_bottom_image.height }}"
                >
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.column_3_enabled %}
        <div class="ai-partnership-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-partnership-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="background-color: {{ block.settings.column_3_accent_color }};"></div>
          
          {% if block.settings.column_3_audience_kicker != blank %}
            <div class="ai-partnership-audience-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="color: {{ block.settings.column_3_accent_color }};">
              {{ block.settings.column_3_audience_kicker }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.column_3_card_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-partnership-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_3_card_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.column_3_features_list != blank %}
            <ul class="ai-partnership-features-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% assign features = block.settings.column_3_features_list | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' %}
              {% for feature in features %}
                {% assign trimmed_feature = feature | strip %}
                {% if trimmed_feature != blank %}
                  <li class="ai-partnership-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <span class="ai-partnership-dash-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="color: {{ block.settings.column_3_accent_color }};">—</span>
                    <span>{{ trimmed_feature }}</span>
                  </li>
                {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ai-partnership-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.column_3_footer_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-partnership-helper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_3_footer_text }}</div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.column_3_bottom_image %}
              <div class="ai-partnership-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <img
                  src="{{ block.settings.column_3_bottom_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                  alt="{{ block.settings.column_3_bottom_image.alt | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ block.settings.column_3_bottom_image.width }}"
                  height="{{ block.settings.column_3_bottom_image.height }}"
                >
              </div>
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-partnership-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-partnership-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</partnership-tiers-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class PartnershipTiers{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }
    }
    customElements.define('partnership-tiers-{{ ai_gen_id }}', PartnershipTiers{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

